ref table dim_product
ref table dim_store
ref table dim_promotion
ref table fact_orders
ref table fact_sales
ref table fact_payments
ref table fact_shipments
ref table fact_returns
ref table fact_reviews
ref table fact_inventory

ref cultureInfo en-US
